                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 895.52/1a.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the American Ambassador.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington, D. C.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-01-23"><hi rendition="#italic">January 23,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Have you made progress in the matter of property rights of foreigners in
                    Korea?</p>
            </div>
